{"unit_id":"Carrick-K7__dsh-keep-going#card-zh","repo":"Carrick-K7/dsh-keep-going","commit":"df1363e43313fbaf29c8be5cd9079ddd31df746a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keep-going 是一款用于 DSH 重启恢复的插件，通过启动时检查已保存会话并恢复符合条件的中断工作，帮助未完成任务在进程重启后继续。它提供等待任务后重启、取消待执行重启、查看恢复状态和清理已停止目标等工具与命令；也会恢复等待用户答复的会话，并将活动目标交还给 DSH 的目标驱动器。适合需要在服务重启后接续 DSH 工作的用户。需要服务管理器在退出后重新启动 DSH；恢复状态写入本机文件，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:120-181","lib/recovery.js:106-115","lib/recovery.js:122-143"]}
{"unit_id":"Carrick-K7__dsh-keep-going#card-en","repo":"Carrick-K7/dsh-keep-going","commit":"df1363e43313fbaf29c8be5cd9079ddd31df746a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-keep-going restores interrupted DSH work after restart by scanning saved sessions. Users can request or cancel a restart, check status, and clear stopped goals. Waiting sessions remain pending; active goals return to DSH. A service manager must restart DSH, and recovery state is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:120-181","lib/recovery.js:106-115","lib/recovery.js:122-143"]}
