{"unit_id":"Carrick-K7__dsh-keep-going#feature-1","repo":"Carrick-K7/dsh-keep-going","commit":"df1363e43313fbaf29c8be5cd9079ddd31df746a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keep-going 的功能「重启后恢复会话」：插件启动时扫描已保存的会话，识别符合条件的中断工作并在恢复后继续；等待用户回答的任务会保持等待，活动目标交由 DSH 目标驱动器处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:176-181","lib/recovery.js:106-115","lib/recovery.js:122-143"]}
